## Description
<!-- ID: description -->
### Summary
tests/test_research_artifact_hygiene.py::test_quality_check_research_prefers_canonical_research_dir_over_top_level_fallback fails alone: quality_check resolves the top-level duplicate instead of research/\<doc\>.md.

### Expected Behaviour
For doc_category=research, canonical research/\<doc\>.md must win over a misplaced project-root duplicate.

### Actual Behaviour
tests/test_research_artifact_hygiene.py::test_quality_check_research_prefers_canonical_research_dir_over_top_level_fallback fails alone: quality_check resolves the top-level duplicate instead of research/\<doc\>.md.

### Steps to Reproduce
- [ ] Run uv run pytest -q tests/test_research_artifact_hygiene.py::test_quality_check_research_prefers_canonical_research_dir_over_top_level_fallback.
- [ ] Observe scope.path resolves the project-root duplicate rather than research/<doc>.md.



